---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Hot Tub Launch — Seize Your Market. Unrivaled Hot Tub Store Dominance."
  description="One hot tub store per market. By application. We expose every digital vulnerability, fortify your position, then unleash proprietary AI ad and outreach strategies to guarantee you command your market."
  ogTitle="Hot Tub Launch — Conquer Your Hot Tub Market. Exclusive AI Advantage."
  pageClass="volt"
>

  <!-- theme-color pinned to the volt palette's --void (#070A12). If <html> is
       switched to data-theme="crimson", the inline theme script updates it to #0A0A0C. -->
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#070A12" />
  <!-- Layout loads Montserrat + Manrope; the volt theme's mono face is JetBrains Mono. -->
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

<script is:inline>
  // Palette override for shareable previews: ?theme=crimson serves the
  // red/white/black skin, anything else keeps the volt default. Runs at the
  // top of the body so the palette is set before the first content paints.
  // (The Astro Layout's <html> carries no data-theme, so volt is applied
  // here rather than baked into the markup.)
  (function(){
    var t = new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('theme');
    if (t !== 'crimson') t = 'volt';
    document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', t);
    var meta = document.querySelector('meta[name="theme-color"]');
    if (meta) meta.setAttribute('content', t === 'crimson' ? '#0A0A0C' : '#070A12');
  })();
</script>

<!-- Zero-size scroll sentinels. These let the nav state and the concierge widget
     react to scroll position through IntersectionObserver, so the scroll handler
     never has to read window.scrollY (a forced layout) on a normal frame. -->
<div class="sentinel" id="topSentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="sentinel" id="heroSentinel" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<div class="stickyhead" id="stickyHead">
  <!-- ANNOUNCEMENT BAR — swap for whichever market status is true right now -->
  <div class="annbar" role="region" aria-label="Announcement"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="anntext">Notice: By application only. One store per market. Elite access is scarce: only a scattering of 2026 territories remain for the chosen few.</span><a href="/apply">Claim Your Territory →</a></div>

  <!-- NAV -->
  <nav class="topnav">
  <div class="navrow">
    <a class="logo" href="#top">
      <svg class="mk" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><ellipse cx="24" cy="37" rx="17" ry="3.4" stroke="#191919" stroke-width="1.6"/><ellipse cx="24" cy="37" rx="10.5" ry="2" stroke="#191919" stroke-width="1.4" opacity=".6"/><circle cx="24" cy="21" r="13" stroke="#191919" stroke-width="1.8"/><path d="M20 34 C18 24 22 15 31 8 C27 17 27 26 28 34 Z" fill="#CE1126"/></svg>
      <span><span class="w1">Hot Tub</span><span class="w2">Launch</span></span>
    </a>
    <div class="navlinks" id="navLinks">
      <a href="#why">Our Covenant</a>
      <a href="#mechanism">The Algorithm</a>
      <a href="#leaks">The Seven Shadow Gates</a>
      <a href="#cases">Dominion</a>
      <a href="/profit-playbook/" class="newpill"><span class="newdot"></span>New Directive: Free AI Blueprint</a>
      <a class="navcta btn btn--primary" href="/apply" style="padding:.7em 1.3em;font-size:.72rem">Seize Your Market</a>
    </div>
    <button class="navburger" id="navBurger" aria-label="Open menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navLinks">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
  </nav>
</div>

<main id="main">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <canvas class="neuralbg" id="neuralBg" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="scanlines" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-spot" id="heroSpot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <span class="kicker2">You're not fighting a fair fight.</span>
  <h1>The buyers you're losing aren't disappearing. They're being systematically rerouted. Away from <em>you</em>.</h1>
  <p class="sub">Every day, the hot tub market shifts beneath your feet. Unseen algorithms, hyper-optimized competitors, and overlooked digital breaches are silently siphoning off your most valuable leads. It's not your fault your current methods can't keep up. But we've reverse-engineered the entire flow. We find the ghost leaks, we seal the hidden siphons, and then we unleash a surge of <em>your</em> uncaptured buyers using intelligence no one else possesses.</p>
  <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/apply"><span class="proc" aria-hidden="true"></span>Secure Your Unclaimed Buyers Now<span class="arrow">→</span></a>

  <div class="stage">
    <div class="fcard c1">
      <span class="connect"></span>
      <span class="icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 17a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 17l4.2-4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="17" r="1.4" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
      <div class="lab">Siphon · Speed</div>
      <div class="val"><span class="from">21.2s</span> <span class="arrow">→</span> <span class="win">2.4s</span></div>
      <div class="cap">Site latency: The invisible barrier turning buyers away in crucial seconds</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard c2">
      <span class="connect"></span>
      <span class="icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M13 3 5 14h6l-1 7 8-11h-6l1-7z" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
      <div class="lab">Siphon · Echo</div>
      <div class="val"><span class="from">0 texts</span> <span class="arrow">→</span> <span class="win">Instant</span></div>
      <div class="cap">Lead response: The silent void where pre-qualified buyers vanish</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard c3">
      <span class="connect"></span>
      <span class="icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.4 8-7 9-3.6-1-7-4-7-9V6l7-3z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>
      <div class="lab">Siphon · Proof</div>
      <div class="val"><span class="from">3 shown</span> <span class="arrow">→</span> <span class="win">142 live</span></div>
      <div class="cap">Hidden resonance: Your most compelling social proof, locked away</div>
    </div>
    <div class="fcard c4">
      <span class="connect"></span>
      <span class="icon"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.2" fill="currentColor"/></svg></span>
      <div class="lab">Siphon · Flow</div>
      <div class="val"><span class="from">9 choices</span> <span class="arrow">→</span> <span class="win">1 step</span></div>
      <div class="cap">Purchase friction: The almost imperceptible resistance point</div>
    </div>

    <!-- SIPHON CORE — the four siphon cards feed into this node via .connect -->
    <div class="core-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="siphon-core">
        <span class="ring r1"></span>
        <span class="ring r2"></span>
        <span class="ring r3"></span>
        <span class="halo"></span>
        <span class="nucleus"></span>
        <span class="clab">Siphon core</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="trust">
    <div class="tlab">Conquered markets. Undeniable dominion. Verified via neural network analysis.</div>
    <div class="tlogos-wrap">
      <div class="tlogos">
        <span>Paradise Spas — Minot, ND</span>
        <span>The Hot Tub Store — Michigan</span>
        <span>Paradise Spas — Minot, ND</span>
        <span>The Hot Tub Store — Michigan</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHY WE EXIST -->
<section class="why" id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal">Our Covenant</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1">Every store is silently bleeding the sales it already commanded.</h2>
    <div class="grid" style="margin-top:1.8rem">
      <div class="reveal d2">
        <p>The demand isn't just "there." It's being <em>precisely targeted</em>. Buyers are online, money in hand, already mentally in their hot tub. But they're not reaching <em>you</em>. Not because they changed their mind, but because they hit a site designed to fail, a follow-up that's dead on arrival, a message that blends into the digital noise, or a complex path that sends them straight to a clearer option.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reveal d3">
        <p>These buyers don't disappear. They're simply redirected to the path of least resistance.</p>
        <p>And the owner sees only a quiet week, a slower showroom. So they pour more money into traffic—which only amplifies the leak. They're effectively paying to speed up their own collapse.</p>
        <p>We don't just find these leaks. We identify the <em>vectors</em> of capture by leveraging proprietary AI. We seal them with surgical precision. Only then do we unleash the full force of a new, hyper-efficient buyer flow.</p>
        <p class="lawbox">This sequence isn't an option. It's the immutable law of digital conquest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MECHANISM -->
<section class="mech grain seam-top" id="mechanism">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow on-ink reveal">The Algorithm</span>
    <h2 class="reveal d1" id="algoH2"><span class="wdrop">The</span> <span class="wdrop">New</span> <span class="wdrop">Axiom</span> <span class="wdrop">of</span> <span class="wdrop">Dominance:</span> <span class="wdrop">Expose.</span> <span class="wdrop">Fortify.</span> <span class="wdrop">Unleash.</span></h2>
    <p class="lede reveal d2">This isn't a "system." It's a predictive algorithm, an advanced intelligence. Every other agency starts with outdated ad buys. We begin by dissecting the core of your digital existence with unseen tools. The order isn't a choice; it's the only pathway to absolute market control.</p>
    <div class="acts">
      <div class="act reveal d1">
        <span class="acticon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M1.8 12S5.6 5.5 12 5.5 22.2 12 22.2 12 18.4 18.5 12 18.5 1.8 12 1.8 12z" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" style="stroke:var(--volt)"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.4" stroke-width="1.6" style="stroke:var(--volt)"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1.2"  style="fill:#CE1126"/></svg></span>
        <div class="n">01 · Expose</div><h3>Act 1 — Expose the Shadow Gates</h3>
        <p>Our "Neural Network Audit" penetrates your online presence, revealing precisely where buyers escape—down to the micro-conversion. We don't just show you numbers; we show you the <em>exact moments</em> of loss, validated by millions of data points from our global network.</p>
        <div class="actviz" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 240 62" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <path d="M8 46 L40 22 L74 38 L108 14 L142 34 L176 20 L210 40 L232 26" stroke-width="1.2" style="stroke:rgba(var(--hair-rgb),.35)"/>
            <path d="M8 54 L40 30 L74 46 L108 22 L142 42 L176 28 L210 48 L232 34" stroke-width="1" style="stroke:rgba(var(--hair-rgb),.18)"/>
            <circle class="leakmark" cx="74" cy="38" r="3.4"  style="fill:#CE1126"/>
            <circle class="leakmark" cx="142" cy="34" r="3.4"  style="fill:#CE1126"/>
            <circle class="leakmark" cx="210" cy="40" r="3.4"  style="fill:#CE1126"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="scan"></span>
        </div>
        <figure class="ai-agent" id="aiAgentCollect">
          <svg class="ai-agent-svg" viewBox="0 0 640 360" role="img"
               aria-label="Abstract animation: an autonomous scanning agent sweeps a stylised web page, drawing visitor signals — speed, clicks, form fills, dwell time — into a central glowing data core.">
            <defs>
              <radialGradient id="aiColCoreGrad" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                <stop class="ai-g0" offset="0%"/>
                <stop class="ai-g1" offset="55%"/>
                <stop class="ai-g2" offset="100%"/>
              </radialGradient>
              <clipPath id="aiColPageClip"><rect x="48" y="48" width="210" height="264" rx="10"/></clipPath>
              <!-- Hot-tub-specific packet glyphs. `currentColor` lets the packet's own
                   colour drive the glyph, including inside the <use> shadow tree. -->
              <symbol id="aiColTub" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M2.5 8.5h11v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-3Z"/>
                <path d="M5 8.5V5a1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 0M10.5 3.2c.9.7.9 1.6 0 2.3M12.8 3c1 .9 1 2 0 2.9"/>
              </symbol>
              <symbol id="aiColDrop" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M8 2.2c2.6 3 4 5 4 6.7a4 4 0 0 1-8 0c0-1.7 1.4-3.7 4-6.7Z"/>
              </symbol>
              <symbol id="aiColCal" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="2.5" y="3.5" width="11" height="10" rx="1.5"/>
                <path d="M2.5 6.6h11M5.5 2v2.6M10.5 2v2.6"/>
                <rect x="6.6" y="8.6" width="2.8" height="2.6" rx=".6" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/>
              </symbol>
              <symbol id="aiColUser" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="8" cy="5.6" r="2.5"/>
                <path d="M2.8 13.4a5.2 5.2 0 0 1 10.4 0"/>
              </symbol>
              <symbol id="aiColBolt" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M9 1.8 4.2 9.1h3.4L7 14.2l4.9-7.4H8.4L9 1.8Z"/>
              </symbol>
              <symbol id="aiColForm" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="2.8" y="2.4" width="10.4" height="11.2" rx="1.4"/>
                <path d="M5.4 6h5.2M5.4 8.6h5.2M5.4 11.2h3"/>
              </symbol>
            </defs>

            <!-- stylised web page under inspection -->
            <g>
              <rect class="ai-frame" x="48" y="48" width="210" height="264" rx="10"/>
              <rect class="ai-block" x="62" y="64" width="182" height="18" rx="3"/>
              <rect class="ai-block" x="62" y="92" width="182" height="52" rx="4"/>
              <rect class="ai-block" x="62" y="154" width="120" height="7" rx="3"/>
              <rect class="ai-block" x="62" y="168" width="152" height="7" rx="3"/>
              <rect class="ai-block" x="62" y="182" width="94"  height="7" rx="3"/>
              <rect class="ai-block" x="62" y="204" width="182" height="46" rx="4"/>
              <rect class="ai-block" x="62" y="262" width="76"  height="18" rx="4"/>
              <g clip-path="url(#aiColPageClip)">
                <rect class="ai-scanline" x="48" y="48" width="210" height="12"/>
              </g>
            </g>

            <!-- signal source nodes on the page -->
            <g>
              <circle class="ai-node" cx="74"  cy="73"  r="3.4"/><text class="ai-lab" x="83"  y="76">speed</text>
              <circle class="ai-node" cx="232" cy="118" r="3.4"/><text class="ai-lab" x="196" y="112">clicks</text>
              <circle class="ai-node" cx="74"  cy="186" r="3.4"/><text class="ai-lab" x="83"  y="189">dwell</text>
              <circle class="ai-node" cx="152" cy="227" r="3.4"/><text class="ai-lab" x="161" y="230">forms</text>
              <circle class="ai-node" cx="100" cy="271" r="3.4"/><text class="ai-lab" x="109" y="274">cta</text>
            </g>

            <!-- convergence lines into the core -->
            <g>
              <path class="ai-link" d="M74 73 C 210 78, 330 120, 428 168"/>
              <path class="ai-link" d="M232 118 C 310 128, 372 148, 428 174"/>
              <path class="ai-link" d="M74 186 C 200 190, 330 186, 426 181"/>
              <path class="ai-link" d="M152 227 C 260 232, 356 210, 428 190"/>
              <path class="ai-link" d="M100 271 C 240 282, 360 232, 430 196"/>
            </g>

            <!-- the agent: a drone-like light, not a figure -->
            <g class="ai-drone" style="offset-path:path('M 70 66 L 244 66 L 244 116 L 70 116 L 70 172 L 244 172 L 244 236 L 70 236 L 70 288 L 244 288')">
              <circle class="ai-drone-ring" cx="0" cy="0" r="9" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>
              <circle class="ai-drone-core" cx="0" cy="0" r="3.2"/>
              <rect class="ai-drone-pip" x="-1" y="-13" width="2" height="4" rx="1"/>
              <rect class="ai-drone-pip" x="-1" y="9"  width="2" height="4" rx="1"/>
            </g>

            <!-- central data core -->
            <g>
              <circle class="ai-core-glow"  cx="470" cy="180" r="74"/>
              <circle class="ai-core-pulse" cx="470" cy="180" r="46"/>
              <circle class="ai-core-shell" cx="470" cy="180" r="44"/>
              <circle class="ai-core-ring"     cx="470" cy="180" r="56"/>
              <circle class="ai-core-ring rev" cx="470" cy="180" r="65"/>
              <g>
                <rect class="ai-core-bar" style="--t:0s"   x="452" y="188" width="4" height="10" rx="2"/>
                <rect class="ai-core-bar" style="--t:.2s"  x="460" y="182" width="4" height="16" rx="2"/>
                <rect class="ai-core-bar" style="--t:.4s"  x="468" y="174" width="4" height="24" rx="2"/>
                <rect class="ai-core-bar" style="--t:.6s"  x="476" y="180" width="4" height="18" rx="2"/>
                <rect class="ai-core-bar" style="--t:.8s"  x="484" y="186" width="4" height="12" rx="2"/>
              </g>
              <text class="ai-lab" x="470" y="252" text-anchor="middle">intake core</text>
              <text class="ai-lab" x="470" y="166" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--neon);opacity:.8">ingest</text>
            </g>

            <!-- packets: page signal -> core. --x0/--y0 = origin, --x1/--y1 = core. -->
            <g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:66px;--y0:65px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:0s;--d:3.1s">
                <use href="#aiColBolt" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:224px;--y0:110px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:.5s;--d:2.7s">
                <use href="#aiColUser" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:66px;--y0:178px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:1s;--d:3.4s">
                <use href="#aiColTub" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:144px;--y0:219px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:1.5s;--d:2.9s">
                <use href="#aiColForm" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:92px;--y0:263px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:2s;--d:3.2s">
                <use href="#aiColCal" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:224px;--y0:110px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:2.4s;--d:3s">
                <use href="#aiColDrop" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:66px;--y0:65px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:2.9s;--d:2.6s">
                <use href="#aiColUser" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:144px;--y0:219px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:3.4s;--d:3.3s">
                <use href="#aiColTub" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:92px;--y0:263px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:3.9s;--d:2.8s">
                <use href="#aiColDrop" width="18" height="18"/></g>
              <g class="ai-pk ai-pk-in" style="--x0:66px;--y0:178px;--x1:462px;--y1:172px;--t:4.4s;--d:3s">
                <use href="#aiColCal" width="18" height="18"/></g>
            </g>
          </svg>
          <figcaption><b>Agent 01</b> · Signal collection<span class="ai-agent-state" data-ai-state>standby</span></figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="act reveal d2">
        <span class="acticon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2.6l7.5 3.2v5.6c0 5.3-3.5 8.6-7.5 10-4-1.4-7.5-4.7-7.5-10V5.8L12 2.6z" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linejoin="round" style="stroke:var(--volt)"/><path d="M8.6 12.2l2.4 2.4 4.4-4.6" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="stroke:var(--neon)"/></svg></span>
        <div class="n">02 · Fortify</div><h3>Act 2 — Fortify the Structure</h3>
        <p>Leveraging insights from hundreds of covertly analyzed competitor campaigns and a decade of dark data patterns, we don't just "seal" leaks. We reconstruct your digital perimeter, rendering it impenetrable. Speed becomes instant. Outreach becomes instinctual. Proof becomes an overwhelming surge.</p>
        <div class="actviz" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 240 62" fill="none" preserveAspectRatio="none">
            <path d="M0 18 C60 18 60 44 120 44" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 4" style="stroke:rgba(206,17,38,.4)"/>
            <path d="M0 44 C60 44 60 18 120 18" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-dasharray="4 4" style="stroke:rgba(206,17,38,.28)"/>
            <rect class="barrier" x="118" y="6" width="4" height="50" rx="2"  style="fill:var(--volt)"/>
            <rect class="barrier" x="128" y="12" width="2" height="38" rx="1"  style="fill:rgba(var(--volt-rgb),.5)"/>
            <path d="M140 31 H236" stroke-width="1.4" style="stroke:var(--neon)"/>
            <circle cx="236" cy="31" r="3"  style="fill:var(--neon)"/>
          </svg>
          <span class="scan"></span>
        </div>
        <figure class="ai-agent" id="aiAgentOrganize">
          <svg class="ai-agent-svg" viewBox="0 0 640 360" role="img"
               aria-label="Abstract animation: raw data leaves the core and passes through three filtration sieves; clean records brighten and stack into an ordered database, while noisy records dim to grey, are rejected, and drop into a discard bin.">
            <defs>
              <radialGradient id="aiOrgCoreGrad" cx="50%" cy="50%" r="50%">
                <stop class="ai-g0" offset="0%"/>
                <stop class="ai-g1" offset="55%"/>
